# Type contracts

`types/index.ts` is the feature's data contract. Export Zod schemas and types inferred from them. Do not export functions.

```ts
export const quoteSelectionsSchema = buildingConfigSchema.extend({
  zip: z.string().trim().min(1),
});

export type QuoteSelections = z.infer<typeof quoteSelectionsSchema>;
```

Do not add guards (`isXYZ`), mappers, formatters, or domain math here. Put those in `utils/`.

Call sites validate with the schema and use `parsed.data`:

```ts
const parsed = quoteSelectionsSchema.safeParse(value);
if (!parsed.success) return;
const selections = parsed.data;
```
